            <ArticleTitle>Gabapentin induced polyneuropathy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>341-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Gabapentin is an effective option for the treatment of neuropathic pain syndromes because of its efficacy and favorable side-effect profile. A case is presented of a 58 year old man who developed a painful polyneuropathy while being treated with gabapentin.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
